    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">al-lambo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adl-</span></b> ), ēre, v. a. (only
		postclass.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to lick
				at</i> or <i>on</i> a thing, <i>to
				lick</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">virides adlambunt ora cerastae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Ham. 135</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 4, p.
				63</span></i>.—<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to touch</i>, <i>come in contact
			with</i>, <i><span class="en">Aus. Mos. 359</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adlambentes flammae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. Decl. 10, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
